(text "TC2050-IDC-NL mechanical footprint; CUSTOM electrical pinout.\nPin 6 is 3.3 V reference OUTPUT, never a programming power input.\nUnused GPIOs are unconnected and initialized to analog mode.\nPA3 monitors 12 V PG; PA4 monitors active-low 5 V fault. No rail ADCs." (at 20 220 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "fe50dd9c-1e64-5fc5-98ea-54306a7b4d6c"))
